# Terraform Module: S3 + RDS + IAM

I'll create a modular Terraform structure supporting dev/prod environments via `tfvars`. This follows the canonical scenario spec with environment-specific sizing and features.

## Directory Structure

```
.
├── modules/
│   ├── s3/
│   │   ├── main.tf
│   │   ├── variables.tf
│   │   └── outputs.tf
│   ├── rds/
│   │   ├── main.tf
│   │   ├── variables.tf
│   │   └── outputs.tf
│   └── iam/
│       ├── main.tf
│       ├── variables.tf
│       └── outputs.tf
├── main.tf
