## Secrets Management

**prod-secrets.tfvars** (never commit; use SOPS or AWS Secrets Manager)
```hcl
db_master_username = "postgres"
db_master_password = "your-secure-password-here"
```

**Using SOPS:**
```bash
sops -e prod-secrets.tfvars > prod-secrets.tfvars.enc
# In CI/CD: sops -d prod-secrets.tfvars.enc > prod-secrets.tfvars.dec
```

