## Usage

### Initialize and Deploy Dev
```bash
# Initialize Terraform
terraform init

# Plan for dev
terraform plan -var-file="dev.tfvars" -var="db_master_username=$DB_USER" -var="db_master_password=$DB_PASS"

# Apply for dev
terraform apply -var-file="dev.tfvars" -var="db_master_username=$DB_USER" -var="db_master_password=$DB_PASS"
```

### Deploy to Prod
```bash
# Plan for prod
terraform plan -var-file="prod.tfvars" -var-file="prod-secrets.tfvars.dec"

# Apply with approval
terraform apply -var-file="prod.tfvars" -var-file="prod-secrets.tfvars.dec"
```

### Using Workspaces (Alternative)
```bash
terraform workspace new dev
terraform workspace new prod
terraform select dev
terraform apply -var-file="common.tfvars"
terraform workspace select prod
terraform apply -var-file="common.tfvars"
```

